                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Just played part of the first level.  Great graphics, good bow control, good realism in arrow flight.  Like the movement system.  This is a very good \"Shooter on Rails\".\n\nThere is no noticable judder on the highest graphic setting, and I'm hardly cutting edge, with a i7 2600 running an Nvidia GTX 980.\n\nThis is a fun game and worth playing!",
